<title>USA: NYSE says Lehman declines comment on stock.</title>
<headline>NYSE says Lehman declines comment on stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday its request for a public statement from Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc regarding the unusual market activity in Lehman's stock was declined by the company.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers said its policy is not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors, the NYSE said in a press release.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers stock was up 4-1/8 at 38-1/4 in afternoon trading amid takeover rumors, traders said.</p>
